data: {"id": "61091e411ba142e1-node_complete-layer", "run_id": "61091e411ba142e1", "seq": 18, "ts_ms": 1788417038648, "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "duration_seconds": 24.956, "state_snapshot": {"layer": "Layer.ABNORMAL", "layers": ["ABNORMAL"], "layer_confidence": 0.5, "layer_reasoning": "集群中存在1个处于异常状态的Pod：`aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w`。该Pod状态为`ContainerCreating`，持续了18分钟。根据`key_facts`提示，该Pod的失败原因为Missing ConfigMap 'unavailable-config'，导致卷挂载失败（FailedMount）。虽然`kubectl get event`针对Pod名称直接查询返回NotFound，但cluster_events摘要明确指出了该Pod的异常类型和原因。根据Runbook，当Events明确指向ConfigMap缺失且Pod spec引用该ConfigMap时，应判定为VolumeMountFailed。其他Namespace（admin, monitor）的状态描述为Health或Timeout，但当前活跃且明确的故障点集中在此Pod上。因此，集群当前状态为ABNORMAL，异常类型为VolumeMountFailed。", "layer_analysis": "{\"layer\": \"1\", \"derived_layer\": \"\", \"layers\": [], \"layer_name\": \"\", \"confidence\": 0.5, \"reasoning\": \"集群中存在1个处于异常状态的Pod：`aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w`。该Pod状态为`ContainerCreating`，持续了18分钟。根据`key_facts`提示，该Pod的失败原因为Missing ConfigMap 'unavailable-config'，导致卷挂载失败（FailedMount）。虽然`kubectl get event`针对Pod名称直接查询返回NotFound，但cluster_events摘要明确指出了该Pod的异常类型和原因。根据Runbook，当Events明确指向ConfigMap缺失且Pod spec引用该ConfigMap时，应判定为VolumeMountFailed。其他Namespace（admin, monitor）的状态描述为Health或Timeout，但当前活跃且明确的故障点集中在此Pod上。因此，集群当前状态为ABNORMAL，异常类型为VolumeMountFailed。\", \"abnormal_pods\": [{\"name\": \"workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w\", \"namespace\": \"aiops-case-03\", \"status\": \"ContainerCreating\"}], \"pod_status_keyword\": \"ContainerCreating\", \"pod_abnormal_type\": \"VolumeMountFailed\", \"status_category\": \"ABNORMAL\", \"key_entities\": [{\"type\": \"Pod\", \"name\": \"workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w\", \"namespace\": \"aiops-case-03\"}, {\"type\": \"ConfigMap\", \"name\": \"unavailable-config\", \"namespace\": \"aiops-case-03\"}], \"possible_scenarios\": [{\"scenario\": \"Pod因引用不存在的ConfigMap导致挂载失败\", \"probability\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"key_facts明确指出Missing ConfigMap 'unavailable-config'导致FailedMount，且Pod处于Contai