data: {"id": "61091e411ba142e1-thinking-parallel_evidence-1127", "run_id": "61091e411ba142e1", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 已采集事实\n\n- **Pod 身份与生命周期**\n  - `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` 当前 **phase=Pending**，容器 `app` 状态为 **Waiting/ContainerCreating**，重启次数为 0。\n  - Pod 调度到节点 **node2**，所有者为 `ReplicaSet/workload-5b5fc86c8c`，标签 `aiops.lab/case-id=c03`。\n  - 这些事实与上游摘要中 “ContainerCreating” 异常状态一致，说明该 Pod 确实未进入 Running。\n\n- **容器日志**\n  - `kubectl logs` 返回 `container \"app\" ... is waiting to start: ContainerCreating`，说明容器尚未启动。\n  - 结合 PromQL 结果中 `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total=0`，日志为空是预期现象，不能作为根因证据，但支持“容器未就绪”", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788417071599, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

