nment:  <none>\n    Mounts:\nVolumes:\n  input:\n    Type:        ConfigMap (a volume populated by a ConfigMap)\n    Name:        unavailable-config\n    Optional:    false\nEvents:\n  Warning  FailedMount  70s (x8 over 17m)   kubelet            Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input], unattached volumes=[input]: timed out waiting for the condition\n  Warning  FailedMount  52s (x17 over 19m)  kubelet            MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found\n关键状态/事件:", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/61091e411ba142e1-g1/tools/007-evidence-kubectl_describe.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/61091e411ba142e1-g1/tools/007-evidence-kubectl_describe.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/61091e411ba142e1-g1/tools/007-evidence-kubectl_describe.summary.txt"}

