个名为 `unavailable-config` 的 ConfigMap，且该引用未被标记为可选 (`Optional: false`)。\n\n由于该 ConfigMap 不存在，Kubelet 无法完成挂载，导致 Pod 卡在 `ContainerCreating` 状态，进而无法启动应用容器。\n\n**支持证据：**\n- `fact-95c07042bd40`：明确报告了 `configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` 的挂载错误。\n- `fact-64ac7ac0317f`：确认了 `ContainerCreating` 的等待原因。\n- `fact-0a0ac0983a7a`：证实了挂载超时重试的现象。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 25.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 49.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w: 49.4s (Evidence 44.4s, RCA 4.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 86.035, "metrics": {"run_id": "61091e411ba142e1", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 86.02732586860657, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weigh